  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi></math>, then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>u</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>u</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>u</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>100</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>24</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>Therefore,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mi>S</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p>",
